# Evaluation evidence. Every semantic run writes its transcripts, snapshots and
# adjudication under these directories — thousands of machine-written files
# that are never edited and that nothing builds from. They are the recorded
# evidence behind Phase 1, M3 and M5 and they stay on disk, immutable, where the
# runners put them; what they are not is source, and a `git add` of a parent
# directory has swept them into the index more than once.
skills/tonight-recommend/evaluation/results/
skills/tonight-recommend/evaluation/m3/results/
skills/tonight-recommend/evaluation/m5/results/
